  <constraints>
    <constraint source="NFR-08">Integration-heavy; vertical-slice seam tests for the new channel (send/archive/ingest), the `IThreadResolver`, and privacy enforcement; preserve existing email inbound matching under characterization tests BEFORE extending.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Seam end-to-end tests live under `tests/integration/seam/**` (vertical-slice-seam KEEP category = DoD for dispatch-spine changes). NO `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, NO DI-registration tests, NO ctor null-check tests; boundary mocks only; `TimeProvider` over `Stopwatch`.</constraint>
